; Vendored, not scanned as first-party: dune builds these without applying this
; project's warning settings, and their own tests are not ours to run.
;
; [ocaml-model-explorer] carries its own [model-explorer] gitlink, which stays
; uninitialised on purpose -- it is the upstream TypeScript renderer, fetched
; from npm at the pinned version rather than built from source here.
;
; [err_trace] is the error framework (module [Err]). Its own test/ needs base,
; lwt, rresult, cmdliner, mirage-flow, logs and yojson -- adapter suites that
; are its business, not ours. [vendored_dirs] is what keeps them off our @all:
; only the src/ library is built, and only because lib/core depends on it.
; Its melange stanza is NOT used here -- see js/melange/vendor/err_trace/dune.

(vendored_dirs ocaml-yamlt opickle ocaml-model-explorer err_trace)
